 Health check: `GET https://api.github.com/user`.
 
+## Results
+
+REST results drop `temp_clone_token` and `temp_download_token`, the short-lived credentials GitHub adds to repository and runner-download reads, wherever a field has one of those names. GitHub's description says to keep the clone token out of logs, and tool results reach agent transcripts. MCP results are unchanged.
+
 ## Known gaps
 
 - Release asset upload (`uploads.github.com`) is skipped.
